				D.S.
				3.67
			</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
				5.74
			</span></i> codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινικ-ιοῦς</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, 
				=
